<title>UK: St George Bank sets 250 mln stg 5-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>St George Bank sets 250 mln stg 5-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers BZW and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ST GEORGE BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     6.25 BP   PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.768    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.768</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
